  "text": "Skip to main content\nclose\nAdd supplemental product data\nhelp_outline\nDresslikemommy\n124884876\narrow_drop_down\nSupplemental data sources are usually added to your existing primary data sources. Select the data sources to which you want to add any missing product details or update existing ones.\nFeed Label\nenter feed label\nedit\nFeed label must be set\nLanguage\nselect language\narrow_drop_down\nLanguage must be set\nPrimary data source that the data from your supplemental data source is added to.\nSelect primary data sources\nsearch\nThere are no primary data sources for this combination of attribute matching, feed label and language\nBack\nCreate data source\nReady to download Press F6 to access notification buttons.\nReady to download\nDownload\nclose\nEnter feed label\nEnter a name that helps you easily categorize and identify your products in Ads campaign. Use only uppercase, digits, hyphen or underscore.\nFeed label\n\u00a0\n2 / 20\nText is 2 characters out of 20\nCancel\nSave\nUSD_544866401\nUS",
